WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In a stream of letters, researchers asked people to catch two targets.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The first arrived. They named it. The second arrived a moment later.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Often, it vanished from the report. Not from the screen.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
This is the attentional blink. It depends on timing and task demands.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Long-term meditation research found changes in one lab measure. It did not test Zen12.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free attention log first. Compare audio on evidence, not promises.
